<h1>Michael Scott, Jr.</h1>
<p>Cook County Commissioner, 2nd District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Democratic. Incumbent.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Scott says his priorities are expanding access to affordable housing and health care. His district office site lists public safety, economic growth, and quality-of-life improvements for residents as his focus areas.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Alderman of Chicago&#39;s 24th Ward from 2015 to 2022, then head of industry and community relations at Cinespace Chicago Film Studios; earlier worked for the Chicago Park District, Chicago Public Schools, and After School Matters.</p>
